# Logging (authentication)

Extends [[/logging|the general logging rules]] rather than restating them. The
absolute form is required here: a bare `[[logging]]` written in this directory
would resolve to this very card.

Never log a bearer token, a refresh token, or an authorization header, including
on the failure path. ^no-token-logging

## Auth-specific fields

Every authentication decision logs the subject, the audience, and the outcome —
never the credential that produced it.

